      <li>Helped in designing a frontend framework.</li>
      <li>
        Designed and deployed the relevant frontend (JS, HTML, CSS, Ajax,
        WebSocket).
      </li>
      <li>Thought out and implemented the UX and parts of the UI.</li>
      <li>Helped in developing a real-time system monitoring tool (C++).</li>
    </ul>
  </ExperienceSection>
  <ExperienceSection
    company="Freelancing"
    title="Scientific Paper Editor/Writer"
    location="Remote (GR)"
    started="2012"
    finished="2019"
  >
    <ul class="xp-list">
      <li>Guided others during writing scientific papers and thesis.</li>
      <li>Proofread scientific papers and thesis.</li>
    </ul>
  </ExperienceSection>
</article>
